## Practical information

The colonnade is freely accessible all year round. The mineral springs flow continuously and can be drunk from free of charge at any time — bring your own cup or buy a traditional spa cup in one of the many souvenir shops. The Singing Fountain operates seasonally from May to October. Admission is free.

The colonnade is easily reached on foot from the town centre — it lies at the southern end of Hlavní třída (the main street), just a few minutes' walk from all the major spa hotels.
